---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" activeTab="about">
  <div style="animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out; padding-top: 1rem;">
    <!-- Large Bold Central/Modern Text -->
    <h1 class="hero-text">
      yo i'm davide<br/>
      <span class="highlight">phd student</span> in physics of <span class="gradient-text">active matter</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="bio-text">
      <p>
        I am a PhD candidate at Gulliver Lab, ESPCI Paris, working under the supervision of Prof. Ludovic Berthier. My research focuses on active and disordered systems using numerical simulations and statistical physics tools to understand non-equilibrium phase transitions and glassy dynamics.
      </p>
      <p>
        Previously, I graduated with a Master's in Physics of Complex Systems (Politecnico di Torino, SISSA, Université Paris Cité), working on Boltzmann Inversion and force inference methods.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll Down Interests Redirecting to Publications -->
    <div class="section-divider"></div>
    
    <div class="interests-section">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Research Interests</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1rem;">
        Click on any area below to view related publications and preprints:
      </p>
      
      <div class="interests-grid">
        <a href="/publications" class="interest-card-link">
          <div class="interest-card">
            <div class="interest-icon">🔋</div>
            <h3 class="interest-title">Active Matter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long arrow-icon"></i></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
              Investigating collective motions and dynamic glassiness of self-propelled particle configurations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/publications" class="interest-card-link">
          <div class="interest-card">
            <div class="interest-icon">🕸️</div>
            <h3 class="interest-title">Statistical Mechanics <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long arrow-icon"></i></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
              Analyzing out-of-equilibrium thermodynamics and phase transitions in disordered interactive systems.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/publications" class="interest-card-link">
          <div class="interest-card">
            <div class="interest-icon">🎲</div>
            <h3 class="interest-title">Monte Carlo Methods <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long arrow-icon"></i></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
              Building high-efficiency stochastic simulations to model many-body transitions and configuration states.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/publications" class="interest-card-link">
          <div class="interest-card">
            <div class="interest-icon">🔍</div>
            <h3 class="interest-title">Inverse Problems <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long arrow-icon"></i></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
              Reconstructing effective pair interactions and forces directly from experimental configurations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 2.85rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .bio-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .section-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-color);
    margin: 4rem 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .interest-card-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
  }

  .interest-card-link:hover {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .arrow-icon {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-4px);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .interest-card:hover .arrow-icon {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(0);
  }
</style>
